#: _translatorinfo.cpp:1
msgid ""
" _: NAME OF TRANSLATORS\n"
" Your names\n"
msgstr "Peter Bradley drwy KGyfiethu\n"

#: _translatorinfo.cpp:3
msgid ""
" _: EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS\n"
" Your emails\n"
msgstr "kyfieithu@dotmon.com\n"

#: ktipwindow.cpp:32
msgid "Kandalf's tips"
msgstr "Cynghorion Kandalf"

#: ktipwindow.cpp:36
msgid "KTip"
msgstr "KTip"

#: ktipwindow.cpp:50
msgid "Kandalf's Useful Tips"
msgstr "Cynghorion Defnyddiol Kandalf"

#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
" <P>\n"
" There's a lot of information about KDE on the\n"
" <A HREF=\"http://www.kde.org/\">KDE web site</A>. There are\n"
" also useful sites for major applications like\n"
" <A HREF=\"http://www.konqueror.org/\">Konqueror</A>, \n"
" <A HREF=\"http://www.koffice.org/\">KOffice</A> and\n"
" <A HREF=\"http://www.kdevelop.org/\">KDevelop</A>, or important\n"
" KDE utilities like\n"
" <A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrint</A>,\n"
" which can be put to its full usage even outside KDE...\n"
" </P>\n"
" \n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
" </center>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>\n"
" Mae llawer o wybodaeth ynglŷn â KDE ar y\n"
" <AHREF=\"http://www.kde.org/\">gwefan KDE</A>. Mae\n"
" gwefannau gwerth eu gweld hefyd am gynhwysiadau bennaf tebyg i\n"
" <AHREF=\"http://www.konqueror.org/\">Konqueror</A>, \n"
" <AHREF=\"http://www.koffice.org/\">KSwyddfa</A> ac\n"
" <AHREF=\"http://www.kdevelop.org/\">KDatblgyu</A>, neu defnyddioldebau pwysig KDE fel\n"
" <AHREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEArgraffu</A>,\n"
" a ellir ei ddefnyddio hyd yn oed tu allan o KDE...\n"
" </P>\n"
" \n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
" </center>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" KDE is translated into many languages. You can change the country and\n"
" language with the Control Center or in\n"
" K-Menu->Preferences->Personalization->Country & Language.\n"
" </p>\n"
" \n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/locale.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Andrea Rizzi</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cyieithir KDE i lawer o ieithoedd. Cewch newid y wlad a'r\n"
" iaith trwy'r Ganolfan Reoli neu yn\n"
" Dewislen-K->Hoffterau->Personaleiddio->Gwlad ac Iaith.\n"
" </p>\n"
" \n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/locale.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfranwyd gan Andrea Rizzi</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:33
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can minimize all your windows on the current desktop at once and\n"
" thus reach the desktop itself by clicking on the desktop icon on the\n"
" panel.</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
" </center>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch leihau ar unwaith pob un o'ch ffenestri ar y penbwrdd cyfredol ac\n"
" felly cyrraedd y penbwrdd ei hun trwy glicio ar eicon y penbwrdd ar y panel.</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
" </center>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:43
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" If you temporarily need more screen real-estate, you can <strong>\"fold\n"
" in\" the panel</strong> by clicking on one of the arrows at the ends of \n"
" the panel. Alternatively, make it auto-hide\n"
" (Preferences/Look&Feel/Panel/Hiding).</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Os ydych angen mwy o le ar y sgrîn dros dro, cewch \n"
"<strong>\"plygu\" y panel i mewn</strong> trwy glicio ar un o'r saethau ar dau ben\n"
" y panel. Fel arall, gwnewch iddo hunan-guddio\n"
" (Hoffterau/Golwg&Theimlad/Panel/Cuddio).</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:51
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" The program Klipper, which is started by default and resides in the\n"
" system tray at the right end of the panel, keeps a number of text\n"
" selections around. These can be retrieved or even (in the case of\n"
" URLs, for example) be executed.</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/klipper.png\">\n"
" </center>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Ceidw'r rhaglen Klipper, a ragosodir i gychwyn ac sy'n \n"
"byw yn y cafn cysawd ar ben de'r panel, nifer o ddewisiadau\n"
" testun. Cewch rheini'n ôl neu hyd yn oed eu rhoi ar \n"
"waith (yn achos URLs, er enghraifft).</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/klipper.png\">\n"
" </center>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:62
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" The window list, which is accessible via an icon on the panel, provides a\n"
" quick overview of all windows on all virtual desktops.</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/window_list.png\">\n"
" </center>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Mae rhestr y ffenestri sydd i'w chael trwy eicon ar y panel yn darparu\n"
" golwg sydyn ar bob ffenestr ar bob rhith-benbwrdd.</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/window_list.png\">\n"
" </center>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:71
msgid ""
" <p>The <b>\"Location\" label</b> in Konqueror is draggable.</p>\n"
" <p>This means you can create shortcuts (e.g. on the desktop or the panel)\n"
" by dragging it there with the mouse. You can also drop it on to Konsole or\n"
" edit fields to get the URL typed in there (as you can with links or files\n"
" displayed in Konqueror).</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Mae'r <b>label \"Lleoliad\"</b> yn Konqueror yn llusgadwy.</p>\n"
" <p> Golyga hyn eich bod chi'n gallu creu byrlwybrau (e.e. ar y penbwrdd neu'r panel)\n"
" trwy ei lusgo yno efo'r llygoden. Cewch hefyd ei ollwng ar Konsole neu\n"
" golygu meysydd i gael yr URL wedi'i deipio i mewn yna (fel y gallwch efo cysylltau neu ffeiliau\n"
" sydd wedi'u harddangos yn Konqueror).</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:79
msgid ""
" <p>For quick access to KDEPrint Manager type\n"
" <strong>\"print:/manager\"</strong>... --  <em>\"Type where?\"</em>,\n"
" you may ask. Type it...</p>\n"
" <ul>\n"
" <li>...either in Konqueror's <i>address field</i>,</li>\n"
" <li>...or in a <i>Run Command</i> dialog,\n"
" opened by pressing <strong>Alt+F2</strong>.</li>\n"
" </ul>\n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Am fynediad sydyn i Reolydd PrintioKDE teipiwch\n"
" <strong> \"print:/manager\"</strong>... -- <em>\"Teipio ble?\"</em>,\n"
" cewch ofyn. Teipiwch o...</p>\n"
" <ul>\n"
" <li>...neill ai yn <i>maes cyfeiriad</i> Konqueror,</li>\n"
" <li>...neu mewn deialog <i>Gorchymyn Rhedeg</i>,\n"
" wedi'i hagor trwy wasgu <strong>Alt+F2</strong>.</li>\n"
" </ul>\n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:94
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" Double-clicking on the titlebar of any window \"shades\" it, which means\n"
" that only the titlebar stays visible. Double-clicking the titlebar a\n"
" second time will make the window visible again.\n"
" Of course, you can change this behavior within the Control Center.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Mae clicio dwbl ar far teitl unrhyw ffenestr yn ei \"chysgodi\" hi, sy'n golygu\n"
" mai dim ond y bar teitl a erys yn weladwy. Bydd clicio dwbl ar y bar teitl eto yn gwneud y ffenestr yn weladwy eto.\n"
" Wrth gwrs, cewch newid yr ymddygiad hwn yn y Ganolfan Reoli.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:103
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can cycle through the windows on a virtual desktop by holding the\n"
" Alt key and pressing Tab or Shift+Tab.</p>\n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kcmkwm.png\"></center></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch droi trwy'r ffenestri ar y rhith benbwrdd trwy ddal yr allwedd Alt tra'n gwasgu Tab neu Shift+Tab.</p>\n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kcmkwm.png\"></center></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:110
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can assign <b>keyboard shortcuts</b> to your favorite applications in the\n"
" KDE menu editor (K-menu -> System -> Menu Editor). Select the application\n"
" (e.g. Konsole), then the tab \"Advanced\" and enter e.g. \"Ctrl+Alt+K\"\n"
" (or use the \"Change\" button).</p>\n"
" <p>That's it! Now fire up Konsoles with Ctrl+Alt+K!</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch aseinio <b>byrlwybrau'r allweddfwrdd</b> i'ch hoff raglenni yng ngolygydd dewislenni KDE (dewislen-K -> Sustem -> Golygydd Dewislenni). Dewiswch y rhaglen\n"
" (e.e. Konsole), yna'r tab \"Uwch\" a rhoi i mewn e.e. \"Ctrl+Alt+K\"\n"
" (neu ddefnyddio'r botwm \"Newid\").</p>\n"
" <p> Dyna fo! Rwan cynnau Konsoles efo Ctrl+Alt+K!</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:119
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can configure the number of virtual desktops by selecting\n"
" Preferences/Look&Feel/Desktop/Number of Desktops from the K menu.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch ffurfweddu nifer y rhith benbyrddau trwy ddewis\n"
" Hofferau/Golwg&Theimlad/Penbwrdd/Nifer y Penbyrddau o'r ddewislen K.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:126
msgid ""
" <p>The KDE project was founded in October 1996 and had its first release,\n"
" 1.0, on July 12, 1998.</p>\n"
" <p>You can <em>support the KDE project</em> with work (programming, designing,\n"
" documenting, proof-reading, translating, etc.) and financial or\n"
" hardware donations. Please contact <a\n"
" href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a>\n"
" if you are interested.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Sefydlwyd prosiect KDE Hydref 1996 a chafodd ei rhyddhau'n gyntaf\n"
" ar Orffennaf 12, 1998.</p>\n"
" <p>Cewch <em>cefnogi prosiect KDE</em> efo rhoddion gwaith (rhaglenni, dylunio, \n"
" dogfenni, darllen proflenni, cyfieithu, ayyb) ac arian neu galedwedd. Cysylltwch â <a\n"
" href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a>\n"
" if you are interested.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:136
msgid ""
" <table><tr>\n"
" <th>Maximize a window</th>\t<th>Click the maximize button</th>\n"
" </tr><tr>\n"
" <td>full-screen</td>\t\t<td>with the left mouse button</td>\n"
" </tr><tr>\n"
" <td>vertically only</td>\t<td>with the middle mouse button</td>\n"
" </tr><tr>\n"
" <td>horizontally only</td>\t<td>with the right mouse button</td>\n"
" </tr></table>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<table><tr>\n"
" <th>Ehangu ffenestr</th>\t<th>Clicio'r botwm ehangu</th>\n"
" </tr><tr>\n"
" <td>sgrîn lawn</td>\t\t<td>efo botwm chwith y llygoden</td>\n"
" </tr><tr>\n"
" <td>yn fertigol yn unig</td>\t<td>efo botwm canol y llygoden</td>\n"
" </tr><tr>\n"
" <td>yn llorweddol yn unig</td>\t<td>efo botwm de y llygoden</td>\n"
" </tr></table>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:148
msgid ""
" <p>You can stay up to date with new developments in KDE and releases\n"
" by regularly checking the web site <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>.</p>\n"
" \n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" <p>Cewch aros yn gyfoes gyda datblygiadau newydd a fersiynau\n"
" trwy edrych yn rheolaidd ar y safwe <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>.</p>\n"
" \n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"
"  \n"

#: tips.cpp:156
msgid ""
" <p align=\"center\"><strong>KDEPrinting (I)</strong></p>\n"
" <p><strong>kprinter</strong>, KDE's new printing utility supports\n"
" different print subsystems. These subsystems differ very much\n"
" in their abilities.</p>\n"
" <p>Amongst the supported systems are:\n"
" <ul>\n"
" <li>CUPS, the new Common UNIX Printing System;</li>\n"
" <li>LPR/LPD, traditional BSD-style printing;</li>\n"
" <li>RLPR (no need for \"printcap\" editing or root privileges to\n"
" use network printers);</li>\n"
" <li>print through external program (generic).</li>\n"
" </ul>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><strong>-->&nbsp;</strong></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>PrintioKDE (I)</strong></p>\n"
" <p><strong>kprinter</strong>, mae cyfleuster printio newydd KDE yn cefnogi\n"
" gwahanol is-sustemau printio. Mae'r is-sustemau hyn yn wahanol iawn eu galluoedd./p>\n"
" <p>Ymhlith y sustemau wedi'u cefnogi ceir:\n"
" <ul>\n"
" <li>CUPS, y Common UNIX Printing System newydd;</li>\n"
" <li>LPR/LPD, printio steil-BSD traddodiadol;</li>\n"
" <li>RLPR (dim angen golygu \"printcap\" na hawliau root i\n"
" ddefnyddio printio rhwydwaith);</li>\n"
" <li>printio trwy raglen allanol (cyffredinol).</li>\n"
" </ul>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><strong>--> </strong></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:172
msgid ""
" <p align=\"center\"><strong>KDEPrinting (II)</strong></p>\n"
" \n"
" <p>Not all print subsystems provide equal abilities\n"
" for KDEPrint to build on.</p>\n"
" <p>The <A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrinting Team</A>\n"
" recommends installing a <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.cups.org/\"><strong>CUPS-based</strong></A>\n"
" software as the underlying print subsystem.</p>\n"
" <p> CUPS provides easy usage, powerful features, broad printer\n"
" support and a modern design (based on IPP, the \"Internet\n"
" Printing Protocol\"). Its usefulness is proven for home users\n"
" as well as for large networks.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>PrintioKDE (II)</strong></p>\n"
" \n"
" <p>Nid yw pob is-sustem printio ddim yn darparu galluoedd cyfartal\n"
" i PrintioKDE adeiladu arnynt.</p>\n"
" <p>Cymeradwya <A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">Tim PrintioKDE</A>\n"
" roi mewn lle meddalwedd <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.cups.org/\"><strong>CUPS-seiliedig</strong></A>\n"
" fel is-sustem printio sylfaenol.</p>\n"
" <p> Mae CUPS yn darparu defnydd esmwyth, nodweddion pwerus, cefnogaeth eang\n"
" o argraffyddion a dyluniaeth fodern (seiliedig ar IPP, \"Protocol Printio'r Rhyngrwyd\"). Mae ei ddefnyddioldeb wedi'i brofi ar gyfer defnyddwyr cartref\n"
" yn ogystal â rhwydweithiau mawr.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Wedi'i gyfrannu gan Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:189
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" KDE is based on a well-designed C++ foundation. C++ is a programming\n"
" language well suited to desktop development. The KDE object model\n"
" extends the power of C++ even further. See\n"
" <a href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org/</a>\n"
" for details.</p>\n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Seilir KDE ar sylfeini C++ da eu dylunwaith. Iaith raglenni addas iawn ar gyfer\n"
" datblygu penbwrdd ydi C++. Mae model gwrthrychau KDE yn ymestyn pwer C++\n"
" ymhellach. Gweler\n"
" <a href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org/</a>\n"
" amfanylion.</p>\n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:199
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can use Konqueror to <strong>browse through tar archives</strong>,\n"
" even compressed ones. You can extract files simply by dragging them\n"
" to another place, e.g. another Konqueror window or the desktop.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch ddefnyddio Konqueror i <strong>bori trwy archifau tar</strong>,\n"
" hyd yn oed rhai crynhoedig. Cewch dynnu ffeiliau 'mond trwy'u llusgo\n"
" i fan arall, e.e. ffenestr Konqueror arall neu'r penbwrdd.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:206
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can cycle through the virtual desktops by holding the Ctrl key and\n"
" pressing Tab or Shift+Tab.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch droi trwy'r rhith benbyrddau trwy ddal yr allwedd Ctrl a gwasgu\n"
" Tab neu Shift+Tab.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:212
msgid ""
" <p>You can start <strong>kprinter</strong> as a standalone program\n"
" from any xterm, Konsole window or from the \"Mini-CLI\" (started by pressing\n"
" <i>Alt+F2</i>). Then select the file to print. You are allowed \n"
" not just one piece or one type at a time, but many, which you can \n"
" print at once...\n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer2.png\"></center>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Cewch gychwyn <strong>kprinter</strong> fel rhaglen ben-ei-hun\n"
" o unrhyw xterm, ffenestr Konsole neu o'r \"Mini-CLI\" (gychwynwyd trwy wasgu\n"
" <i>Alt+F2</i>). Dewiswch wedyn y ffeil i'w brintio. Cewch nid dim ond\n"
" un darn neu deip ar un adeg, ond nifer, y gallwch brintio yr un amser...\n"
"</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer2.png\"></center>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:224
msgid ""
" <p>You may at any time switch <strong>kprinter</strong> to another\n"
" print subsystem \"on the fly\" (and you don't need to be root to do it.)\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p>Laptop users who frequently change to different environments may find\n"
" <A HREF=\"ftp://truffula.com/pub/\">RLPR</A> a useful complement to CUPS\n"
" (or any other print subsystem they use as their preferred one).\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Cewch ar unrhyw adeg newid <strong>kprinter</strong> i is-sustem\n"
" printio arall \"wrth fynd heibio\" (ac nid oes rhaid mai root ydych chi i'w wneud.)\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p>Gall defnyddwyr cluniaduron sy'n newid sefyllfa'n aml gael bod\n"
"<A HREF=\"ftp://truffula.com/pub/\">RLPR</A> yn ddewis arall addas i CUPS\n"
" (neu unrhyw is-sustem printio arall y'i defnyddir ganddyn nhw fel eu hoff sustem).\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:235
msgid ""
" <P>\n"
" KDE's help system can display not only KDE's own HTML-based help, but\n"
" also info and man pages.</P>\n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\"></center>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>\n"
" Gall sustem cymorth KDE dangos nid yn unig ei gymorth sail HTML KDE ei hun\n"
" ond hefyd tudalennau info a man.</P>\n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\"></center>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:242
msgid ""
" <P>Clicking with the right mouse button on panel icons or applets opens a\n"
" popup menu that allows you to move or remove the item, or add a new one.</ P>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>Mae clicio efo botwm de'r llygoden ar eiconau'r panel neu apledi'n agor\n"
" naidlen sy'n eich galluogi i symud neu ddileu'r eitem, neu ychwanegu un newydd.</P>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:247
msgid ""
" <P>If a toolbar is not large enough to display all buttons on it, you can\n"
" click on the small arrow at the far right end of the toolbar to see\n"
" the remaining buttons.</P>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>Os na fydd bar offer yn ddigon mawr i arddangos arno fo'r botymau i gyd, cewch\n"
" glicio ar y saeth bach ar y pen pellaf i'r dde o'r bar offer i weld\n"
" y botymau sy'n weddill.</P>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:253
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" Need comprehensive info about KDEPrinting? </p>\n"
" <p> Type <strong>help:/kdeprint/</strong> into a Konqueror address field\n"
" and get the\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/documentation/handbook/\">KDEPrint Handbook</a>\n"
" displayed.</p> <p>This, plus more material (like a\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/faq/\">FAQ</a>, various \n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/documentation/tutorials/\">Tutorials</ a>, \n"
" a \"TipsNTricks\" section and the\n"
" <a href=\"http://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/kde-print/\">kdeprint mailing list</a>) \n"
" are available at\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">printing.kde.org</a>... \n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer2.png\">\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Angen gwybodaeth lawn am PrintioKDE? </p><p> Teipiwch <strong>help:/kdeprint/</strong> i mewn i faes cyfeiriad Konqueror\n"
" a chael <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/documentation/handbook/\">Llawlyfr PrintioKDE</a>\n"
" wedi'i arddangos.</p> <p>Mai hwn, a rhagor o ddeunydd (fel \n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/faq/\">FAQ</a>, amryw o\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/documentation/tutorials/\">Diwtorials</ a>, \n"
" adran \"TipsNTricks\" a\n"
" <a href=\"http://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/kde-print/\">rhesr bostio printiokde</a>) \n"
" ar gael o\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">printing.kde.org</a>... \n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer2.png\">\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:271
msgid ""
" <P>You can run non-KDE applications without problems on a KDE\n"
" desktop. It is even possible to integrate them into the menu system.\n"
" The KDE program \"KAppfinder\" will look for known programs to integrate\n"
" them into the menu.</P>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>Cewch redeg rhaglenni di-KDE yn ddi-drafferth ar benbwrdd KDE.\n"
" Mae'n bosibl hyd yn oed i'w cymhathu i fewn i'r sustem dewislenni.\n"
" Bydd y rhaglen \"KAppfinder\" yn chwilio am raglenni adnabyddedig\n"
" i'w cymhathu i fewn i'r ddewislen.</P>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:278
msgid ""
" <p>You can quickly move the panel to another screen edge by \"grabbing\" it with\n"
" the left mouse button and moving it to where you want it.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Cewch symud y panel yn sydyn i sgrïn arall trwy \"gydio\" ynddo efo\n"
" botwm chwith y llogen a'i symud i le bynnag 'dych chi ei eisiau.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:283
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" If you need to kill some time, KDE comes with an extensive collection\n"
" of games.</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/package_games.png\">\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Os ydych eisiau lladd peth amser, daw KDE efo casgliad eang o gemau.\n"
"</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/package_games.png\">\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:291
msgid ""
" <p>You can <strong>quickly change the background</strong> image of the\n"
" desktop by dragging a graphics image from a Konqueror window to the\n"
" desktop background.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Cewch <strong>newid llun cefndir y penbwrdd</strong> yn sydyn trwy\n"
" lusgo llun graffeg o ffenestr Konqueror i gefndir y penbwrdd.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:297
msgid ""
" <p>You can change the background color of the desktop by dragging a color\n"
" from a color selector in any application to the desktop background.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Cewch newid lliw cefndir y penbwrdd trwy lusgo lliw o'r dewisydd lliwiau\n"
" mewn unrhyw raglen i genfdir y penbwrdd.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:303
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" A fast way to get your favorite application onto your panel is to\n"
" right-click the panel (Panel Menu) and select Add/Button/whatever.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Ffordd sydyn o gael eich hoff raglen ar eich panel ydi i glicio-dde'r\n"
" panel (Dewislen y Panel) a dewis Ychwanegu/Botwm/beth bynnag.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:310
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can add more applets to your panel by selecting Panel\n"
" Menu/Add/Applet from the K menu.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch ychwanegu rhagor o apledi i'ch panel trwy ddewis Dewislen\n"
" y Panel/Ychwanegu/Apled o'r ddewislen K.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:317
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can add a little command line to your panel by selecting Panel\n"
" Menu/Add/Applet/Application Launcher from the K menu.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch ychwanegu llinell orchmynion bach i'ch panel trwy ddewis Dewislen\n"
" y Panel/Ychwanegu/Apled/Lawnsydd Rhaglenni o'r ddewislen K.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:324
msgid ""
" <p>Want to see the local time of your friends or \n"
" business partners <b>around the world</b>?</p>\n"
" <p>Just press the middle mouse button on the <b>panel clock</b>.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hoffech chi weld amser lleol eich ffrindiau neu\n"
" barneriaid busnes <b>rownd y byd</b>?</p>\n"
" <p>'Mond ichi wasgu botwm canol y llygoden ar <b>gloc y panel</b>.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:330
msgid ""
" <p>Your <b>panel clock</b> can be configured to display the time\n"
" in <b>plain</b>, <b>digital</b>, <b>analog</b> or <b>fuzzy-style</b>\n"
" mode.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Gellir ffurfweddu'ch <b>cloc panel</b> i arddangos yr amser\n"
" mewn modd <b>plaen</b>, <b>digidol</b>, <b>analog</b> neu <b>steil-aneglur</b></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:336
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" If you know its name, you can <strong>execute any program</strong> by pressing\n"
" <strong>Alt+F2</strong>\n"
" and entering the program name in the command-line window provided.<p>\n"
" \n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/go.png\">\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Os ydych yn gwybod beth ydi ei enw, cewch <strong>redeg unrhyw raglen</strong>\n"
" trwy wasgu <strong>Alt+F2</strong>\n"
" a rhoi enw'r rhaglen yn y ffenestr llinell orchmynion ddarparedig.<p>\n"
" \n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/go.png\">\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:346
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can <strong>browse any URL</strong> by pressing\n"
" <strong>Alt+F2</strong> and entering the URL in the\n"
" command-line window provided.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/ftp.png\">\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch <strong> bori unryw URL</strong> trwy wasgu\n"
" <strong>Alt+F2</strong> a rhoi'r URL yn y\n"
" ffenestr llinell orchmynion ddarparedig\n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/ftp.png\">\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:356
msgid ""
" <p>If you are using Konqueror and want to type another location into\n"
" the location field below the toolbar to get there, you can clear the\n"
" whole field very quickly with the black button with a white cross\n"
" to the left of the \"Location\" label and start typing.</p>\n"
" <p>You can also press Ctrl+O to open a dialog to enter another location.</ p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Os ydych yn defnyddio Konqueror ac eisiau teipio lleoliad arall i\n"
" fewn i'r maes lleoliad islaw'r bar offer i'w gyrraedd, cewch glirio'r\n"
" maes i gyd yn sydyn iawn efo'r botwm du â'r groes wen\n"
" i'r chwith o'r label \"Lleoliad\" a chychwyn teipio.</p>\n"
" <p>Cewch hefyd wasgu Ctrl+O i agor deialog i roi lleoliad arall i fewn.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:364
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can access a <strong>man page</strong> by entering a\n"
" hash mark (#) and the name of the man page wherever you can enter\n"
" a URL, like in the location field of the web browser or the\n"
" <strong>Alt+F2</strong> command-line.</p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\">\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch gael <strong>tudalen man</strong> trwy roi marc hats (#)\n"
" i fewn ac enw'r dudalen man ble bynnag y cewch roi URL i fewn\n"
", fel ym maes lleoliadau'r we-borydd neu'r llinell orchmynion\n"
" <strong>Alt+F2</strong>.</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\">\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:374
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can access an <strong>info page</strong> by entering a double hash mark (##)\n"
" and the\n"
" name of the info page wherever you can enter a URL, like in the URL\n"
" line of the web browser or the <strong>Alt+F2</strong> command-line.\n"
" </p>\n"
" \n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\">\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch gael <strong>tudalen info</strong> trwy roi marc hats dwbl (##) ac enw'r\n"
" we-borydd neu'r llinell orchmynion <strong>Alt+F2</strong>.\n"
" </p>\n"
" \n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\">\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:386
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" If you can't access the titlebar, you can still <strong>move a window</ strong>\n"
" on the screen by holding the Alt key, clicking anywhere into the window\n"
" and \"dragging\" it with the mouse.</p>\n"
" Of course, you can change this behavior by using the Control Center.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Os na fedrwch gael y bar teitl, cewch <strong>symud ffenestr</strong> o hyd\n"
" ar y sgrîn trwy ddal yr allwedd Alt, clicio unrhywle i fewn i'r ffenestr\n"
" a'i \"llusgo\" efo'r llygoden.</p>\n"
" Wrth gwrs, cewch newid yr ymddygiad hwn tryw ddefnyddio'r Ganolfan Reoli.\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:394
msgid ""
" <p> Want KDE's printing power in non-KDE apps?  </p>\n"
" <p> Then use <strong>'kprinter'</strong> as \"print command\". \n"
" Works with Netscape, Mozilla, Galeon, gv, Acrobat Reader,\n"
" StarOffice, OpenOffice, any GNOME application and many more...</p>\n"
" <p>See <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/faq/kdeprint.phtml#out\">printing. kde.org</a> \n"
" for more detailed hints...\n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Eisiau pwer printio KDE mewn rhaglenni di-KDE? </p>\n"
" <p> Yna ddefnyddiwch <strong>'kprinter'</strong> fel \"gorchymyn printio\". \n"
" Yn gweithio efo Netscape, Mozilla, Galeon, gv, Acrobat Reader,\n"
" StarOffice, OpenOffice, unrhyw raglen GNOME a llawer mwy...</p>\n"
" <p>Gweler <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/faq/kdeprint.phtml#out\">printing.kde.org</a> \n"
" am awgrymiadau mwy manwl...\n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:407
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can <strong>resize a window</strong> on the screen by holding the Alt key,\n"
" right-clicking anywhere into the window and moving the mouse.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch <strong>newid maint ffenestr</strong> ar y sgrîn trwy ddal yr allwedd Alt,\n"
" de-glicio unrhywle i fewn i'r ffenestr a symud y llygoden.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:413
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" KDE's mail client (KMail) provides seamless <strong>PGP/GnuPG\n"
" integration</strong>\n"
" for encrypting and signing your email messages.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Darpara cleiant post KDE (KMail) <strong>cymhathu PGP/GnuPG\n"
"</strong>\n"
" esmwyth at amgodio ac arwyddo'ch negeseuon ebost.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:420
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can find KDE developers all over the world, e.g., in Germany,\n"
" Sweden, France, Canada, USA, Australia, Namibia, Argentina, even in\n"
" Norway!</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch hyd i ddatblygwyr KDE dros y byd i gyd, e.g. Yn yr Almaen,\n"
" Sweden, Ffrainc, Canada, UDA, Awstralia, Namibia, yr Ariannin, yn Norwy hyn yn oed!</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:427
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" KDE's CD player accesses the Internet CD database freedb to provide you\n"
" with title/track information.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Eith chwareuydd CD KDE at gronfa ddata CD y Rhyngrwyd freedb i ddarparu ichi\n"
" wybodaeth teitlau a thraciau.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:434
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" Some people open many terminal windows just to enter <em>one single</em>\n"
" command.</p>\n"
" <ul>\n"
" <li>Use <strong>Alt+F2</strong> for just firing up programs (Alt+F2 \"kword \") or\n"
" <li>use Konsole sessions (\"New\" in toolbar) if you need text output.\n"
" </ul>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Bydd rhai pobl yn agor llawer o ffenestri terfynnell 'mond i roi <em>un gorchymyn yn unig</em> i fewn.</p>\n"
" <ul>\n"
" <li>Defnyddiwch <strong>Alt+F2</strong> er mwyn gwneud dim ond cynnau rhaglenni (Alt+F2 \"kword \" neu\n"
" <li>ddefnyddio sesiynau Konsole (\"Newydd\" yn y bar offer) os ydych angen allbwn testun.\n"
" </ul>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:444
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can change the color of the window titlebars by selecting\n"
" <em>Preferences/Look&Feel/Colors</em> from the K menu.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch newid lliw bariau teilau ffenestri trwy ddewis\n"
" <em>Hoffterau/Golwg&Theimlad/Lliwiau</em> o ddewislen K.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:451
msgid ""
" <p align=\"center\"><strong>KDE Command Line Printing (I)</strong></p>\n"
" <p> Want to print from command line, without missing KDE's printing power?</ p>\n"
" <p> Type <strong>'kprinter'</strong>. Up pops the\n"
" KDEPrint dialog. Select printer, print options and\n"
" print files (and yes!! you may select <em>different</em>\n"
" files of <em>different</em> types for <em>one</em> print job...). </p>\n"
" <p>This works from Konsole, any x-Terminal, or \"Run Command\"\n"
" (called by pressing <em>Alt+F2</em>)</p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><strong>-->&nbsp;</strong></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>Printio Llinell Orchmynion KDE (I)</strong></p>\n"
" <p> Eisiau printio o'r llinell orchmynion, heb golli pwer printio KDE?</ p>\n"
" <p> Teipiwch <strong>'kprinter'</strong>. Neidia'r\n"
" ddeialog PrintioKDE i fyny. Dewis argaffydd, opsiynau printio a\n"
" ffeiliau i'w printio (a chewch!! cewch ddewis <em>gwahanol</em> ffeiliau o <em>wahanol</em> fathau ar gyfer <em>un</em> jobyn printio...). </p>\n"
" <p>Geithia hyn o Konsole, unrhyw Terfynell-x, neu \"Rhedeg Gorchymyn\"\n"
" (wedi'i bywiogi trwy wasgu <em>Alt+F2</em>)</p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><strong>--> </strong></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:463
msgid ""
" <p align=\"center\"><strong>KDE Command Line Printing (II)</strong></p>\n"
" <p>\n"
" You may specify print files and/or name a printer from the command line:\n"
" <pre> kprinter -d infotec \\\n"
" /home/kurt/paragliding.jpg \\\n"
" ../kdeprint-handbook.pdf \\\n"
" /opt/kde3/flyer.ps\n"
" </pre>\n"
" This prints 3 different files (from different directories) to printer \"infotec\".\n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>Printio Llinell Orchmynion KDE (II)</strong></p>\n"
" <p>\n"
" Cewch ddynodi ffeiliau i'w printio a/neu enwi argraffydd o'r llinell orchmynion:\n"
" <pre> kprinter -d infotec \\\n"
" /home/kurt/paragliding.jpg \\\n"
" ../kdeprint-handbook.pdf \\\n"
" /opt/kde3/flyer.ps\n"
" </pre>\n"
" Bydd hyn yn argraffu 3 gwahanol ffeil (o cyfeirlyfrau gwahanol) i argraffydd \"infotec\".\n"
" /p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:479
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" The difference between window manager styles and old-fashioned themes is\n"
" that the former even reflect window titlebar color settings from the\n"
" Control Center and might implement different features.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Y gwahaniaeth rhwng steiliau'r rheolydd ffenestri a'r themau hen-ffasiwn ydi\n"
" y bydd yr un cyntaf yn adlewyrchu hyd yn oed gosodiadau lliwiau bar teitl y ffenestr a gall roi gwahanol nodweddion ar waith.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:486
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" The K in KDE does not stand for anything. It is the character that comes\n"
" before L in the Latin alphabet, which stands for Linux. It was chosen\n"
" because KDE runs on many types of UNIX (and perfectly well on FreeBSD).\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Ni saif y K yn KDE am unrhywbeth. Y llythyren a ddaw o flaen L yn y wyddor\n"
" Lladin ydio, sy'n sefyll am Linux. Dewiswyd am fod KDE yn rhedeg\n"
" ar lawer o wahanol fathau ar UNIX (ac yn hollol iawn ar FreeBSD).\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:494
msgid ""
" <p>If you want to know when <b>the next release</b> of KDE is planned,\n"
" look for the release schedule on <a\n"
" href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org</a>. If you only\n"
" find old release schedules, there will probably be some weeks/months of\n"
" intensive development left before the next release.</p>\n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Os ydych am wybod pryd bydd <b>rhyddhau nesaf</b> KDE wedi'i gynllunio, \n"
"edrychwch am y cynllun rhyddhau ar<a\n"
" href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org</a>. Os na chewch ond cynlluniau hen bydd, debyg, rai wythnosau/misoedd o\n"
" ddatblygu dwys ar ôl, cyn y rhyddhau nesaf./p>\n"
" <center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:503
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" Under the <em>\"B II\"</em> window decoration, the title bars\n"
" automatically move by themselves so they are always visible! You can\n"
" edit your title bar decoration by right clicking on your title bar and\n"
" selecting \"Configure...\".</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" O dan addurniad ffenestr <em>\"B II\"</em>, symuda'r bariau teitlau\n"
" yn awtomatig ar eu pennau eu hunain fel eu bod bob amser yn y golwg! Cewch\n"
" olygu'ch addurniad bar teitl trwy dde-glicio'ch bar teitl a\n"
" dewis \"Ffurfweddu...\".</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:511
msgid ""
" <p>If you don't like the default completion mode, e.g. in Konqueror, you\n"
" can right-click on the edit-widget and choose a different mode, e.g.\n"
" automatic or manual completion. Manual completion works similar to\n"
" completion in a UNIX shell. Use Ctrl+E to invoke it.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Os nad ydych chi ddim yn hoffi'r modd cwblhau rhagosodedig, cewch e.e. yn Konqueror, dde-glicio ar y widget-golygu a dewis modd gwahanol, e.e.\n"
" cwblhau awtomatig neu â llaw. Gweithia cwblhau â llaw yn debyg i\n"
" gwblhau mewn cregyn UNIX. Defnyddiwch Ctrl+E i'w alw i fyny.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:519
msgid ""
" <p>If you want another panel, to make more space for your applets and \n"
" buttons, press right mouse button on the panel to invoke the panel menu\n"
" and select \"Add->Extension->Child Panel\".</p><p>\n"
" (You can then put anything on the fresh panel, adjust its size and\n"
" so on.)</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Os ydych eisiau panel arall, i wneud mwy o le i'ch apledi a \n"
" botymau, gwasgwch botwm de'r llygoden ar y panel i alw dewislen y panel i fyny\n"
" a dewis \"Ychwanegu->Estyniad->Panel Plentyn\".</p><p>\n"
" (Cewch yna roi unrhywbeth ar y panel newydd, addasu ei faint ac\n"
" ati.)</p> \n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:527
msgid ""
" <p>If you want to contribute your own \"tip of the day\", please send it to\n"
" <a href=\"mailto:kalle@kde.org\">kalle@kde.org</a>, and we'll be happy to\n"
" integrate\n"
" it for the next release.</p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Os ydych eisiau cyfrannu'ch \"cynghoryn y dydd\", a wnewch ei ddanfon at\n"
" <a href=\"mailto:kalle@kde.org\">kalle@kde.org</a>, ac mi fyddwn yn falch o'i\n"
" integreiddio\n"
" at y rhyddhau nesaf.</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:534
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" If you drag a file from Konqueror or from the desktop to Konsole, you\n"
" will have the choice between pasting the URL or entering that directory.</ p>\n"
" <p>\n"
" Choose the one you want, so you do not have to write the entire path\n"
" in the terminal window.</p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Gerard Delafond</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Os llusgwch chi ffeil o Konqueror neu o'r penbwrdd i Konsole, cewch\n"
" chi'r dewis rhwng pastio'r URL neu fynd i fewn i'r cyfeirlyfr hwnnw.</p>\n"
" <p>\n"
" Dewiswch p'run 'dych chi eisiau, fel na fydd rhaid ichi sgwennu'r llwybr i gyd\n"
" i ffenestr y terfynell.</p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Gerard Delafond</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:544
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can hide mixer devices in KMix by clicking on \"Hide\" in the\n"
" context menu that appears when you click with the right mouse button\n"
" on one of the sliders.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Stefan Schimanski</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch guddio dyfeisiadau cymysgu yn KMix trwy glicio ar \"Cuddio\" yn y\n"
" naidlen a ymddengys pan gliciwch efo botwm de'r llygoden ar un o'r\n"
" sglefrenni.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Stefan Schimanski</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:553
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can add your own \"Internet Keyword search provider\" by selecting\n"
" Settings->Configure Konqueror->Enhanced Browsing. Click \"Add...\" and\n"
" complete the fields.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Michael Lachmann and Thomas Diehl</ em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch ychwanegu'ch \"darparwr chwiliad Allweddair y Rhyngrwyd\" eich hun trwy ddewis\n"
" Gosodiadau->Ffurfweddu Konqueror->Pori Uwch. Cliciwch \"Ychwanegu...\" a\n"
" chwblhau'r meysydd.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Michael Lachmann and Thomas Diehl</ em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:562
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" Each UNIX user has a so-called Home directory in which his or her\n"
" files as well as user-dependent configuration files are saved. If you\n"
" work in a Konsole window, you can easily change to your home directory\n"
" by entering the <b>cd</b> command without any parameters.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Mae gan bob defnyddiwr UNIX gyfeirlyfr cartref bondigrybwyll lle cedwir\n"
" ei ffeiliau yn ogystal â ffeiliau gosodiadau defnyddiwr-seiliedig.\n"
" Pe byddech yn gweithio mewn ffenestr Konsole, cewch newid yn hawdd i'ch cyfeirlyfr cartref trwy roi'r gorchymyn <b>cd</b> heb barametrau.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:572
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You might wonder why there are very few (if any) files whose\n"
" names end in <code>.exe</code> or <code>.bat</code> on UNIX\n"
" systems. This is because filenames on UNIX do not need an\n"
" extension. Executable files in KDE are represented by the gear icon\n"
" in Konqueror. In the Konsole window, they are often colored red \n"
" (depending on your settings).\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Hwyrach eich bod chi'n meddwl pam fo cyn lleied (os o gwbl) o\n"
" ffeiliau ag enwau sy'n gorffen gydag <code>.exe</code> neu \n"
"<code>.bat</code> ar sustemau UNIX. Am nad ydi\n"
" enwau ffeiliau ar UNIX ddim angen estyniad ydi hyn. Cynrychiolir\n"
" ffeiliau rhedadwy yn KDE gan yr eicon gêr yn Konqueror. Maen nhw'n cael eu lliwio'n goch yn aml iawn yn ffenestr Konsole (gan ddibynnu\n"
" ar eich gosodiadau).\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:584
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" If you want to make your desktop look more interesting, you can find\n"
" tons of themes on <a href=\"http://www.kde-look.org/\">www.kde-look.org</ a>.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Os ydych am wneud i'ch penbwrdd edrych yn fwy diddorol, cewch hyd i dunnelli o themau ar <a href=\"http://www.kde-look.org/\">www.kde-look.org</ a>.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:592
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" Did you know that you can use the middle mouse button to paste\n"
" text? Try selecting some text with the left mouse button and click\n"
" elsewhere with the middle mouse button. The selected text will be\n"
" pasted at the click position. This even works between different programs.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Wyddoch chi eich bod chi'n medru defnyddio botwm canol y llygoden\n"
" i *** testun? Triwch ddewis peth testun gyda botwm chwith\n"
" y llygoden a chlicio rhywle arall efo botwm canol y llygoden.\n"
" Ceith y testun dewisiedig ei *** yn lleoliad y clic.\n"
" Gweithia hyn hyd yn oed rhwng gwahanol raglenni.n </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:602
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" Want to print by using \"DragNDrop\"?\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p>\n"
" Drag a file and drop it on the \"Files\" tab of an opened\n"
" <strong>kprinter</strong> dialog. </p>\n"
" <p>Then continue as you would normally: select a printer, job options, etc.\n"
" and click the \"Print\" button.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer2.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Eisiau printio trwy ddefnyddio \"Llusgo a Gollwng\"?\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p>\n"
" Llusgwch ffeil a'i ollwng ar dab \"Ffeiliau\" deialog agored \n"
"<strong>kprinter</strong>. </p>\n"
" <p>Wedyn cariwch chi ymlaen fel arfer: dewis argraffydd, opsiynau'r jobyn, ayyb\n"
" a chlicio'r botwm \"Printio\".n </p>\n"
" <center>\n"
" <img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer2.png\">\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:617
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" If you need to calculate a distance on the screen, the program\n"
" <em>kruler</em> can be of great help.</p>\n"
" <p>\n"
" Furthermore, if you need to look closely at the ruler to count single\n"
" pixels, <em>kmag</em> may be very useful. (It is not part of the KDE base\n"
" installation but needs to be installed separately. It might already be\n"
" available on your distribution.) <em>kmag</em> works\n"
" just like <em>xmag</em>, with the difference that it magnifies on the fly.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jesper Pedersen</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Os ydych angen gweithio allan rhyw bellter ar y sgrîn, \n"
"yna gall rhaglen <em>kruler</em> fod o help mawr.</p>\n"
" <p>\n"
"Mwy, os ydych angen edrych yn fanwl ar y mesurydd i \n"
"gyfrif picselau unigol, gall <em>kmag</em> fod yn ddefnyddiol\n"
"iawn. ('Dyw hi ddim yn rhan o arsefydliad sylfaenol KDE ond\n"
"mae angen ei arsefydlu ar wahân. Gall fod ar gael eisoes yn\n"
"eich dosbarthiad.) Gweithia <em>kmag</em> yn union fel \n"
"<em>xmag</em>, efo'r gwahaniaeth ei bod hi'n chwyddo ar y tro.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Jesper Pedersen</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:631
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" Sound in KDE is coordinated by the <b>artsd</b> sound server. You can\n"
" configure the sound server from the Control Center by selecting\n"
" Sound->Sound Server.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jeff Tranter</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cyd-drefnir sain yn KDE gan y gweinydd sain <b>artsd</b>. Cewch ffurfweddu'r gweinydd sain o'r Ganolfan Reoli trwy ddewis Sain->Gweinydd Sain.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:640
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can associate sounds with KDE events. This can be configured\n"
" from the Control Center by selecting Sound->System Notifications.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jeff Tranter</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch gysylltu seiniau efo digwyddiadau KDE. Ceir ffurfweddu hyn o'r Ganolfan Reoli trwy ddewis Sain->Sustem Hysbysiadau.\n"
" </p> \n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Jeff Tranter</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:648
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" Most non-KDE sound applications that do not know about the sound server can be\n"
" run using the <b>artsdsp</b> command. When the application is run, accesses to\n"
" the audio device will be redirected to the <b>artsd</b> sound server.\n"
" </p>\n"
" \n"
" <p>\n"
" The command format is:\n"
" <b>artsdsp</b> <em>application</em> <em>arguments</em> ...\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jeff Tranter</em></p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Gellir rhedeg y rhan fwyaf o raglenni sain di-KDE sy ddim yn gwybod am y gweinydd sain wrth ddefnyddio'r gorchymyn <b>artsdsp</b>. Pan fydd y rhaglen yn rhedeg, ail-gyfeirir mynediad i'r ddyfeis awdio i'r gweinydd sain <b>artsd</b>.\n"
" </p>\n"
" \n"
" <p>\n"
" Fformat y gorchymyn ydi:\n"
" <b>artsdsp</b> <em>rhaglen</em> <em>ymresymiadau</em> ...\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p align=\"right\"><em>Cyfrannwyd gan Jeff Tranter</em></p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:662
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" By holding down the <b>Shift</b> button while moving a container (button\n"
" or applet) on the Panel, the container can then be used to push forward\n"
" other containers.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Trwy ddal y botwm <b>Shift</b> i lawr tra'n symud cynhwysydd (botwm\n"
" neu apled) ar y Panel, ceir defnyddio'r cynhwysydd i wthio ymlaen\n"
" cynwysyddion eraill.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:670
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" You can let KDE turn the <b>NumLock</b> ON or OFF at startup.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p>\n"
" Open the Control Center  -> Peripherals -> Keyboard and make your\n"
" choice.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Cewch adael i KDE troi'r <b>NumLock</b> YMLAEN neu I FFWRDD wrth gychwyn.\n"
" </p>\n"
" <p>\n"
" Agorwch y Ganolfan Reoli -> Ymylolion -> Allweddell a gwnewch eich dewis.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:680
msgid ""
" <p>\n"
" This is the last tip in the tips database. Clicking \"Next\" will take you back to\n"
" the first tip.\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" Hwn yw'r cynghoryn olaf yng nghronfa ddata'r cyngorynnau. Bydd clicio ar \"Nesaf\" yn mynd â chi'n ôl i'r cynghoryn cyntaf\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

